"陕西方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1春，正月，壬寅，安西副大都護趙頤貞敗吐蕃于曲子城。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月初五日壬寅，安西副大都护赵颐贞在曲子城击败了吐蕃军队。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，壬寅，安西副大都护赵颐贞败吐蕃于曲子城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21432,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bcdf7414-db0e-11ef-bf75-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宣撫使始此。使，疏吏翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宣抚使始此。使，疏吏翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"bce13a59-db0e-11ef-83e8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"魏州刺史","official_note":"魏州刺史是唐代地方行政長官，掌管魏州（今河北大名一帶）的民政事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，宇文融原任此職，後被任命為戶部侍郎並繼續兼任魏州刺史，顯示其地方治理經驗受到重視。","official_rank":"從三品","source_snippet":"以魏州刺史宇文融爲戶部侍郞兼魏州刺史","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"d411aef5-320a-4b5d-a686-74c7cec5a281"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"財政","official_name":"戶部侍郞","official_note":"戶部侍郎是唐代中央財政機構戶部的副長官，協助尚書管理戶籍、賦稅等事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，宇文融被任命為此職，反映其在財政方面的專長，可能與其後續擔任宣撫使的職責相關。","official_rank":"正四品下","source_snippet":"以魏州刺史宇文融爲戶部侍郞兼魏州刺史","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"7728b010-2b73-436a-b0ec-b3531bca4b4e"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"河北道宣撫使","official_note":"河北道宣撫使是唐代臨時設置的官職，負責安撫、巡視河北道（今河北、遼寧一帶）的軍政事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，宇文融兼任此職，旨在加強中央對河北地區的控制，應對可能的邊境或內部動盪。","official_rank":"臨時差遣，品秩不定","source_snippet":"充河北道宣撫使","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"06d38052-a272-4ccc-bbe1-a56947ef8825"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":730,"link_td_description":"宇文融，京兆府万年县（今陕西西安市长安县）人，唐朝宰相。","link_td_id":"Q10011081","link_td_number_id":1216597,"people_name":"宇文融","people_name_jianti_auto":"宇文融","people_xingming":"宇文融","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bce13a5a-db0e-11ef-912b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏州","place_note":"河北大名","resolved_place_entity_id":8,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bce13a5b-db0e-11ef-a5cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏州","resolved_place_entity_id":8,"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"bce13a5c-db0e-11ef-ab40-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河北道","place_name_jianti_auto":"河北道","place_note":"河北","resolved_place_entity_id":284,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"bce13a5d-db0e-11ef-8501-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"2甲寅，以魏州刺史宇文融爲戶部侍郞兼魏州刺史，充河北道宣撫使。","content_fanyi":"正月十七日甲寅，玄宗任命魏州刺史宇文融为户部侍郎，仍兼魏州刺史，并充任河北道宣抚使。","content_jianti_auto":"2甲寅，以魏州刺史宇文融为户部侍郞兼魏州刺史，充河北道宣抚使。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21433,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bce13a58-db0e-11ef-a890-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"瀧，閭江翻。獠，魯皓翻。考異曰：本紀作「馮仁智」。今從楊思勗傳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"泷，闾江翻。獠，鲁皓翻。考异曰：本纪作「冯仁智」。今从杨思勗传。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"bce13a5f-db0e-11ef-9201-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"定國大將軍","official_note":"定國大將軍是自封的軍事職位，在唐代通常為高級將領稱號，此處何遊魯反叛時自稱，用於標誌其軍事領導地位。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"遊魯稱定國大將軍","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9c23ffab-c88c-42a1-945f-b254a92e6caf"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"南越王","official_note":"南越王是自封的王爵，在唐代非正式官職，此處馮璘反叛時自稱，用於宣示其地方統治權。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"璘稱南越王","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"598eb1a8-e297-4e92-a404-3bec84aec4a3"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"宮廷內官","official_name":"內侍","official_note":"內侍是唐代宮廷宦官職位，掌管宮廷事務，此處楊思勗被任命為內侍，負責調兵平定叛亂。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"命內侍楊思勗發桂州及嶺北近道兵討之","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"f17fa661-8b31-463e-b7e1-36625f442810"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"陳行範","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈行范","people_xingming":"陈行范","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"bce13a63-db0e-11ef-9364-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"馮璘","people_name_jianti_auto":"冯璘","people_xingming":"冯璘","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"bce13a64-db0e-11ef-b237-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"何遊魯","people_name_jianti_auto":"何游鲁","people_xingming":"何游鲁","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"bce13a65-db0e-11ef-8da6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"行範","people_name_jianti_auto":"行范","people_xingming":"陈行范","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"bce13a6b-db0e-11ef-baa7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"遊魯","people_name_jianti_auto":"游鲁","people_xingming":"何游鲁","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"bce13a6c-db0e-11ef-b420-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"璘","people_name_jianti_auto":"璘","people_xingming":"冯璘","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"bce13a6d-db0e-11ef-a4b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"南越王","people_name_jianti_auto":"南越王","people_xingming":"冯璘","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"bce13a6e-db0e-11ef-af08-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":653,"link_death_year":740,"link_td_description":"杨思勖，罗州石城县人，唐朝宦官，本为苏姓，随养父姓氏。少年时为给事内侍省，跟随唐玄宗讨韦后、太平公主，擢升为左监门卫将军，唐玄宗倚重他。","link_td_id":"Q10003743","link_td_number_id":1461237,"people_name":"楊思勗","people_name_jianti_auto":"杨思勗","people_xingming":"杨思勖","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"bce13a6f-db0e-11ef-86b6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"bce13a5e-db0e-11ef-8658-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"shuāng","source_anchor_text":"使乙卯春瀧等州獠陳","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":6,"text":"瀧","tongjian_id":"f9a1f545-a11d-5bb4-ab3e-850bf9511229"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"春","place_name_jianti_auto":"春","place_note":"广东阳春市","resolved_place_entity_id":2874,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bce13a66-db0e-11ef-8c79-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"瀧","place_name_jianti_auto":"泷","place_note":"广东罗定南","resolved_place_entity_id":2700,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bce13a67-db0e-11ef-b07c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"獠","place_name_jianti_auto":"獠","resolved_place_entity_id":542,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bce13a68-db0e-11ef-9019-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廣州","place_name_jianti_auto":"广州","place_note":"广东广州","resolved_place_entity_id":328,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bce13a69-db0e-11ef-8db7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"獠","place_name_jianti_auto":"獠","resolved_place_entity_id":542,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"bce13a6a-db0e-11ef-95ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"嶺","place_name_jianti_auto":"岭","resolved_place_entity_id":326,"start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"bce13a70-db0e-11ef-bbfa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"桂州","place_name_jianti_auto":"桂州","place_note":"广西桂林","resolved_place_entity_id":730,"start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"bce13a71-db0e-11ef-a4f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"嶺","place_name_jianti_auto":"岭","resolved_place_entity_id":326,"start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"bce13a72-db0e-11ef-a41f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"3乙卯，春、瀧等州獠陳行範、廣州獠馮璘、何遊魯反，陷四十餘城。行範稱帝，遊魯稱定國大將軍，璘稱南越王，欲據嶺表；命內侍楊思勗發桂州及嶺北近道兵討之。","content_fanyi":"正月十八日乙卯，春州、泷州等地的僚人陈行范与广州僚人冯璘、何游鲁造反，攻陷四十多座城池。陈行范称皇帝，何游鲁称定国大将军，冯璘称南越王，企图占据岭南；玄宗命令内侍杨思勖征调桂州及岭北附近各道的军队前去征讨他们。","content_jianti_auto":"3乙卯，春、泷等州獠陈行范、广州獠冯璘、何游鲁反，陷四十余城。行范称帝，游鲁称定国大将军，璘称南越王，欲据岭表；命内侍杨思勗发桂州及岭北近道兵讨之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21434,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bce13a5e-db0e-11ef-8658-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"建议开垦九河故道为稻田并折换陆运钱","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_BCE13A73DB0E11EFB03AA0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"魏州刺史","official_note":"魏州刺史是唐代地方行政官职，负责管理魏州（今河北地区）的民政事务。在上下文中，宇文融原任此职，后被调任。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以魏州刺史宇文融","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"318141f9-45b2-406d-96bc-5c5c6e9b665d"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"檢校汴州刺史","official_note":"檢校汴州刺史是唐代地方行政官职，檢校表示代理或兼任，汴州（今河南开封）刺史负责管理该州事务。在上下文中，宇文融被任命此职，同时兼任其他使职。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"宇文融檢校汴州刺史","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b55a8b1a-7a73-442e-9d91-dfa2e2bb0692"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"财政或工程管理","official_name":"河南北溝渠堤堰決九河使","official_note":"河南北溝渠堤堰決九河使是唐代临时设置的使职，负责管理河南、河北地区的沟渠、堤堰和九河水利工程。在上下文中，宇文融兼任此职，提议开垦稻田和调整运输以增加政府收入。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"充河南北溝渠堤堰決九河使","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"2678b9f6-f728-4423-b595-363c771cd237"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":730,"link_td_description":"宇文融，京兆府万年县（今陕西西安市长安县）人，唐朝宰相。","link_td_id":"Q10011081","link_td_number_id":1216597,"people_name":"宇文融","people_name_jianti_auto":"宇文融","people_xingming":"宇文融","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bce13a75-db0e-11ef-a56e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":730,"link_td_description":"宇文融，京兆府万年县（今陕西西安市长安县）人，唐朝宰相。","link_td_id":"Q10011081","link_td_number_id":1216597,"people_name":"融","people_name_jianti_auto":"融","people_xingming":"宇文融","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"bce13a7a-db0e-11ef-b94d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏州","place_note":"河北大名","resolved_place_entity_id":8,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"bce13a76-db0e-11ef-bfa9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"汴州","place_name_jianti_auto":"汴州","place_note":"河南开封","resolved_place_entity_id":257,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"bce13a77-db0e-11ef-9e10-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","resolved_place_entity_id":59,"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"bce13a78-db0e-11ef-88d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九河","place_name_jianti_auto":"九河","resolved_place_entity_id":2789,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"bce13a79-db0e-11ef-83d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"九河","place_name_jianti_auto":"九河","resolved_place_entity_id":2789,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"bce13a7b-db0e-11ef-a166-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"4丙寅，以魏州刺史宇文融檢校汴州刺史，充河南北溝渠堤堰決九河使。融請用禹貢九河故道開稻田，幷回易陸運錢，官收其利；興役不息，事多不就。","content_fanyi":"正月二十九日丙寅，唐玄宗任命魏州刺史宇文融为检校汴州刺史，并让他充任黄河南北沟渠堤堰决九河使。宇文融请求利用《禹贡》所载九条河流的故道开垦稻田，并折换陆路运输费用，由官府收取利钱；他不停地征发劳役，但事情大多没有办成。","content_jianti_auto":"4丙寅，以魏州刺史宇文融检校汴州刺史，充河南北沟渠堤堰决九河使。融请用禹贡九河故道开稻田，幷回易陆运钱，官收其利；兴役不息，事多不就。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21435,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"bce13a73-db0e-11ef-b03a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張說","people_name_jianti_auto":"张说","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"bce13a7f-db0e-11ef-a200-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史言張說寵顧不衰。尚，辰羊翻。相，息亮翻。說，讀爲悅。使，疏吏翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史言张说宠顾不衰。尚，辰羊翻。相，息亮翻。说，读为悦。使，疏吏翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"bce13a7e-db0e-11ef-9b5e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"尚書右丞相","official_note":"尚书右丞相是唐代尚书省的最高长官之一，负责协助皇帝处理国家政务。在《资治通鉴》此段中，张说以尚书右丞相的身份致仕（退休），但仍被任命为集贤殿学士，表明他虽离开政务核心，仍受皇帝重视，参与文史工作。","official_rank":"正二品","source_snippet":"以尚書右丞相致仕張說兼集賢殿學士","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"cd7f2314-e51d-4924-a845-3937cab08969"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"集賢殿學士","official_note":"集贤殿学士是唐代集贤殿书院的官职，负责图书整理、文史编修和顾问咨询。在此段中，张说被任命为此职，说明他退休后仍承担文史职责，反映了唐代对学者型官员的重视。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以尚書右丞相致仕張說兼集賢殿學士","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"237b8f03-2ec4-457b-8c16-2f1d0e7ae8eb"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":667,"link_death_year":731,"link_td_description":"张说，字道济，一字说之，河南府洛阳县（今河南省洛阳市东）人，祖籍范阳郡方城县（今河北省固安县）。唐玄宗宰相，封燕国公。擅长文学，当时朝廷重要辞章多出其手，尤长于碑文墓志，与许国公苏颋齐名，并称“燕许大手笔”。","link_td_id":"Q10002389","link_td_number_id":356114,"people_name":"張說","people_name_jianti_auto":"张说","people_xingming":"张说","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"bce13a80-db0e-11ef-b957-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":667,"link_death_year":731,"link_td_description":"张说，字道济，一字说之，河南府洛阳县（今河南省洛阳市东）人，祖籍范阳郡方城县（今河北省固安县）。唐玄宗宰相，封燕国公。擅长文学，当时朝廷重要辞章多出其手，尤长于碑文墓志，与许国公苏颋齐名，并称“燕许大手笔”。","link_td_id":"Q10002389","link_td_number_id":356114,"people_name":"說","people_name_jianti_auto":"说","people_xingming":"张说","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"bce13a81-db0e-11ef-8b11-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"集賢殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"集贤殿","resolved_place_entity_id":3034,"start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"bce13a82-db0e-11ef-9257-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"5二月，壬申，以尚書右丞相致仕張說兼集賢殿學士。說雖罷政事，專文史之任，朝廷每有大事，上常遣中使訪之。","content_fanyi":"二月初六日壬申，玄宗任命以尚书右丞相退休的张说兼任集贤殿学士。张说虽然被罢去参与政事的职务，专门负责文史方面的工作，但每当朝廷遇到重大事务，玄宗常常派遣中使前去征询他的意见。","content_jianti_auto":"5二月，壬申，以尚书右丞相致仕张说兼集贤殿学士。说虽罢政事，专文史之任，朝廷每有大事，上常遣中使访之。","dtjl_paragraph_l