，是也。"},{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...卑湳羌地，居大榆中，始强盛。所云允谷、盐池，即此谷也。○","source_end_index":113,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d343b2ef-e55b-5f8b-9bee-948915fd70d7","source_start_index":72,"source_text":"渴波谷，在卫境青海西。唐开元十五年，河西节度使萧嵩、陇右节度使张忠亮，大破吐蕃于此"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十三、西宁卫（卷六十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"7秋，七月，吐蕃大將悉末朗寇瓜州；都督張守珪擊走之。乙巳，河西節度使蕭嵩、隴右節度使張忠亮大破吐蕃於渴波谷；忠亮追之，拔其大莫門城，擒獲甚衆，焚其駱駝橋而還。","content_fanyi":"秋季，七月，吐蕃大将悉末朗进犯瓜州，都督张守珪将其击退。七月十一日乙巳，河西节度使萧嵩、陇右节度使张忠亮在渴波谷大败吐蕃军队；张忠亮乘胜追击，攻克吐蕃的大莫门城，擒获大量俘虏，并焚毁当地的骆驼桥后返回。","content_jianti_auto":"7秋，七月，吐蕃大将悉末朗寇瓜州；都督张守珪击走之。乙巳，河西节度使萧嵩、陇右节度使张忠亮大破吐蕃于渴波谷；忠亮追之，拔其大莫门城，擒获甚众，焚其骆驼桥而还。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21438,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"bce13a85-db0e-11ef-b42c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"一行","people_name_jianti_auto":"一行","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"bce13aa4-db0e-11ef-a2b8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"僧一行推大衍數立術，以應氣朔及日食以造新曆，故曰大衍曆。上，時掌翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"僧一行推大衍数立术，以应气朔及日食以造新历，故曰大衍历。上，时掌翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"bce13aa3-db0e-11ef-85d8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"散官","official_name":"特進","official_note":"特進是唐代的散官，授予功勋卓著或退休的高级官员，表示荣誉地位，无具体行政职责。在上下文中，张说以特進身份上呈《开元大衍历》，显示其作为资深官员的权威和影响力。","official_rank":"正二品","source_snippet":"特進張說","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"aeca0662-9676-4d43-b419-d8c29718457f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":667,"link_death_year":731,"link_td_description":"张说，字道济，一字说之，河南府洛阳县（今河南省洛阳市东）人，祖籍范阳郡方城县（今河北省固安县）。唐玄宗宰相，封燕国公。擅长文学，当时朝廷重要辞章多出其手，尤长于碑文墓志，与许国公苏颋齐名，并称“燕许大手笔”。","link_td_id":"Q10002389","link_td_number_id":356114,"people_name":"張說","people_name_jianti_auto":"张说","people_xingming":"张说","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"bce13aa6-db0e-11ef-9a49-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/八月端午","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。”《唐类表》有宋璟《请以八月五日为千秋节表》云：“月惟...","context_before":"...宗以八月五日生，以其日为千秋节。张说《上大衍历序》云：“","source_end_index":49,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b28dcfd5-1bd9-4322-9074-19c0b111a363","source_start_index":30,"source_text":"谨以开元十六年八月端午赤光照室之夜献之"}],"path":"随笔/卷一/八月端午","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/治历明时","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，而《革》卦之序，在《周易》正当四十九，然则专为历甚明。...","context_before":"...革命，盖谓是耳，非论其取天下也。况《大衍》之用四十有九，","source_end_index":376,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"475c6130-d2e8-4359-ad32-c79b0f280474","source_start_index":370,"source_text":"一行以之起历"}],"path":"四笔/卷十二/治历明时","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"8八月，乙巳，特進張說上開元大衍曆，行之。","content_fanyi":"八月初六日乙巳，特进张说进呈《开元大衍历》，唐玄宗下令颁布施行。","content_jianti_auto":"8八月，乙巳，特进张说上开元大衍历，行之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":21439,"number":8,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"bce13aa2-db0e-11ef-ab64-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"祁連城","place_name_jianti_auto":"祁连城","place_note":"甘肃民乐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"bce13aaa-db0e-11ef-a95b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"甘州","place_name_jianti_auto":"甘州","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"bce13aab-db0e-11ef-8ad2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"張掖縣","place_na